#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:5
#: 5987434a1216442785b20c8399fee11d
msgid "Setup the Build Environment on Windows"
msgstr "在 Windows 上配置构建环境"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:7
#: edd0433d786e40b0bde9670d3cad0003
msgid ""
"There are two options for building on Windows: Windows Subsystem for "
"Linux (WSL) or Cygwin. New developers should use WSL as it offers faster "
"compilation times, greater compatibility, and a larger support base from "
"other developers."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上构建有两种方式：适用于 Linux 的 Windows 子系统（WSL）或 Cygwin。新开发者应使用 "
"WSL，因为它编译速度更快、兼容性更好，并且拥有更多其他开发者的支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:11
#: 0973510b7ad6415f82740d8771a690e6
msgid "Setup for building with waf using WSL (Windows 10 and 11 only)"
msgstr "使用 WSL 配合 waf 进行构建的配置方法（仅限 Windows 10 和 11）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:13
#: 9dc4b9162d0f4dd7b44cbb5d555b2141
msgid ""
"Install WSL as described `here <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/windows/wsl/install>`__"
msgstr "按照 `此处 <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/install>`__ 的说明安装 WSL"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:14
#: 25d9bb6dd28f421e96dd850b693e278a
msgid ""
"If Windows 10 :ref:`follow these instructions <building-setup-"
"windows10_new>`, if Windows 11 :ref:`follow these instructions <building-"
"setup-windows11>`."
msgstr ""
"如果是 Windows 10，请 :ref:`按照这些说明操作 <building-setup-windows10_new>`；如果是 "
"Windows 11，请 :ref:`按照这些说明操作 <building-setup-windows11>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:15
#: b55bd0ce9a5c4c688a8bbe409691f077
msgid ""
"(optional, if you wish to use VSCode editor) :ref:`Setup VSCode as "
"described here <editing-the-code-with-vscode>`"
msgstr "（可选，如需使用 VSCode 编辑器） :ref:`按照此处说明配置 VSCode <editing-the-code-with-vscode>`"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:19
#: 2c54b597abd24d2286c7523e07037dc2
msgid "Setup for building with waf using Cygwin"
msgstr "使用 Cygwin 配合 waf 进行构建的配置方法"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:23
#: c1732a144edf4f31a38b840b52b4c397
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Cygwin is not recommended for new developers. However, building using "
"Cygwin is sometimes useful if you need to compile SITL binaries for "
"Windows. However, you can create Windows SITL executables without using "
"Cygwin, following the instructions given :ref:`here <mp-sitl-custom-"
"code>`."
msgstr ""
"不建议新开发者使用 Cygwin。但是，如果需要为 Windows 编译 SITL 二进制文件，有时使用 Cygwin "
"构建会很有用。不过，您也可以按照 :ref:`此处 <mp-sitl-custom-code>` 的说明，在不使用 Cygwin 的情况下创建 "
"Windows SITL 可执行文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:25
#: 2076845e3f1744ce91c2e1bf43309c65
msgid ":ref:`Install Cygwin as described here <building-setup-windows-cygwin>`"
msgstr ":ref:`按照此处说明安装 Cygwin <building-setup-windows-cygwin>`"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows.rst:26
#: f42ed770de8a4041aea19180446e99df
msgid ""
":ref:`Setup Eclipse as described here <building-setup-windows-eclipse>` "
"(optional)"
msgstr ":ref:`按照此处说明配置 Eclipse <building-setup-windows-eclipse>` （可选）"

